ibution amounts reported.,0.5,N/R,No summary efficiency statistics tied to φ0 levels are presented.,0.4,N/R,"Fig. 6 reports only shirking, not average payoffs.",0.4,N/A,No humans.,1,N/A,No humans.,1,N/A,No humans.,1,N/A,No humans.,1,No human,Computational parameter sweep.,1,"Same evolutionary public-good-like environment as baseline; the only independent variation is the per-period fitness φ0 of ostracized/solitary agents in the pool. For each value of φ0, ten simulation runs of 30,000 periods are conducted, and the average shirking over the last 1000 periods is recorded.",Summarizes the structure of the first panel in Fig. 6.,0.9
