ns.,1,N/A,No humans.,1,No human,Analytical and simulation study.,1,"Optional participation with strategies X (contributors, no punishment), Y (defectors), Z (non-participants), V (pool-punishers). Payoff for non-participants σ satisfies 0 < σ < (r−1)c − G. Without second-order punishment, stationary frequencies are (2,2,2,1)/7 over (X,Y,Z,V), leading to little cooperation.",Directly from main text explaining this case.,0.95
