 age range N/R),Adult participants in subsistence-oriented communities; details not given.,0.6,N/R,Gender composition not reported.,0.1,Primarily adults from small-scale subsistence communities with limited formal education,Same as for UG in this project.,0.6,Field experiment,Field implementation in multiple communities.,1,"Third-party punishment game used across 33 communities to estimate MAOs for TPG. Figure 3b shows that large communities exhibit much greater willingness to pay to punish unfair offers than small communities, with many individuals in large communities punishing anything but equal splits.",Summarized from description of Figure 3 and Henrich et al. (2010).,1
