3,N/A,No humans.,1,N/A,No humans.,1,N/A,No humans.,1,N/A,No humans.,1,No human,Agent-based simulation with punishment.,1,"Well-mixed PG game with k=4, N=1024, linear synergy r, and costly punishment of defectors. Four conceptual strategy types (cooperators, defectors, moralists, immoralists) but here punishment probability pP is exogenously fixed and not evolved, approximating mean punisher density ρP≈pP. Punishment has effect β=0.8 and cost γ=0.2. Simulations over 200K update windows show that increasing pP shifts the critical synergy r_c=(k+1)(1−βρP) to lower values, enabling cooperation at smaller r.",Summarizes structural and parametric setup plus main qualitative result for this family of conditions.,1
