ow fractions of runs where CP (or cooperative strategies) win (blue), DN wins (red), DA wins (yellow), or no convergence (white). Pattern resembles DN-majority case: DN tends to win when β is small, DA when β intermediate, CP when β large, illustrating dependence on β even when cooperation starts prevalent.",From Figure 3B caption and text in Section 4.2.,1
