nal model.,1.0,"Same individual-based rules as slow-resource simulation. Parameter regime: ec < r < ed with r=0.6, bm=0.5, N=1000, Rm=1000, α=0.5. Strong institutions (p=0.5, β=0.5) imply large pβ, leading simulations to converge to a sustainable state with high cooperation and non-depleted resource, matching analytical prediction of convergence toward full or dominant cooperators with positive y.",Derived from Fig 6 description for powerful institutions at moderate growth.,0.9
