10.1038_srep07843.md,Treatment m=5 (memory of 5 actions),Treatment defined by memory length m=5.,1,Memory length of past actions shown (m=5; last 5 actions of every participant visible),Independent variable is memory m; here m=5.,1,True,Human-subject lab sessions.,1,True,Controlled experimental design with predefined treatment m=5.,1,True,Conducted in on-site experimental economics lab.,1,False,No computer-only model for this treatment.,1,False,Not an analytical treatment.,1,21.5,Same groups distribution as for m=3 and m=5 combined; use average 21.5 due to lack of exact per-treatment split.,0.5,25,All treatments lasted 25 rounds.,1,1,Players choose C or D only.,1,0,Binary PD actions; no explicit endowment or default contribution pool.,0.5,N/R,No linear public goods MPCR specified.,0,0,Anonymity and inability to interact imply no chat.,1,0,"Subjects receive individual action histories, not summary statistics.",0.7,0,Punishment done via link severing; no separate punishment identity feature.,0.3,0,No explicit reward mechanism included.,1,0,Number of rounds not revealed to players.,1,1,Link breaking as punishment with reputational basis.,1,0,No token cost is reported for breaking links.,0.4,0,No numeric punishment intensity parameter; effect is loss of neighbour.,0.3,0,No explicit costly rewards.,1,N/A,No reward mechanism.,1,N/A,No reward mechanism.,1,N/R,Endowment or starting balance not specified.,0,0.588,"Table 1, fraction of cooperative actions for m=5 is 0.588.",1,N/R,No quantitative contribution unit beyond binary C/D.,0,N/R,Efficiency not reported.,0,N/R,Group payoff amounts not provided.,0,Spain,Same Spanish university lab setting.,1,N/R,No age information.,0,N/R,No gender information.,0,University students (undergraduate and postgraduate),"Volunteer pool open to university students at any degree/level, including postgraduate.",0.9,On site,Sessions in a physical experimental economics lab.,1,"Same iterated multi-player PD with dynamic network. For m=5, subjects