alues.",0.3,N/R,Group payoff functions are symbolic only.,0.4,N/A,No human subjects involved.,1.0,N/A,No human subjects.,1.0,N/A,No human subjects.,1.0,N/A,No human subjects.,1.0,No human,Purely theoretical/simulation study.,1.0,"Three strategies: C, D, and peer excluders E (denoted I_E for T=0). Cooperators and excluders contribute c; defectors contribute 0. Total cooperative contributions multiplied by r and shared among non-excluded players. Excluders pay cost c_E per defector plus monitoring cost τ; defectors are fully excluded from benefits when excluders present. Evolutionary dynamics exhibit a heteroclinic cycle on boundary and a stable limit cycle in interior under certain parameter ranges.",Summarized from Appendix B.1–B.4 for peer exclusion case.,1.0
