on.",0.6,N/R,Individual-level reclaim frequencies for this specific condition are not separately reported.,0.3,N/R,No explicit or computable efficiency measure by condition is provided.,0.3,N/R,Mean earnings per group or per condition are not reported.,0.3,Switzerland,Same participant pool for all treatments.,1,Mean 23.1 years (s.d. 3.13),Overall sample description applies here.,1,52.5% female,Overall sample composition applies to each treatment approximately; no breakdown by treatment.,0.9,University students,All participants were students from University of Zurich and ETH Zurich.,1,On site,Lab sessions conducted in person at ETH Zurich.,1,"Same VOD structure as part 1: person X can steal 70 MU from each of three others (total 210 MU). If at least one of the three chooses 'up', the stealing is undone, each of the three pays 30 MU if they chose 'up', and X pays an additional fixed penalty of 120 MU regardless of the number of punishers.",Summarizes rules with high penalty.,1
