e not reported.,0.3,Switzerland,Same pool of Zurich-based students.,1,Mean 23.1 years (s.d. 3.13),Overall sample description used for all treatments.,1,52.5% female,Applies to total sample; no per-treatment data.,0.9,University students,All participants are university students.,1,On site,Lab-based experimental sessions.,1,"Same VOD as in other parts: X may steal 70 MU from each of the three others. If any of the three choose 'up', the steal is undone and X is additionally penalized 40 MU regardless of the number of punishers; each punisher pays 30 MU.",Summarizes rules for low-penalty symmetric condition.,1
