dition is a computer simulation.,1,Same collective action game and reinforcement learning; first-order public goods with J=0.5; external moral sanctions have partial jointness J'=0.5 and accelerating production m=2; hypocrites are discredited so only compliant actors exert moral influence; simulations show severe start-up problems and equilibrium at about 45% cooperation without reaching critical mass.,Summarizes how the moral-sanction condition differs from material-incentive condition.,0.92
