bject pool of Maastricht University students.,0.95,"Mean age 21.1 years (SD 2.6), adults",Overall age distribution given; assignment random.,1,"204 female, remaining male (146), overall sample",Only overall gender stats reported.,0.7,Undergraduate university students,Participants described as undergraduate students.,1,On site,Conducted in BEElab with physical cubicles.,1,"From round 1: public goods game only; round 2: public goods game with punishment; rounds 3–20: same as round 2 (no power transfer stage). Each participant's punishment power remains fixed at 1 for the entire experiment, yielding a 1:1 effectiveness-to-cost ratio of punishment.",Summarizes that this condition omits the power transfer stage and fixes power at 1.,1
