hics.,1,34% male,Table 1 for Study 2 total.,1,University students,Study 2 also uses student populations.,1,On site,"Same mixed online/university-computer setting as Study 1, stated that procedure was like Study 1.",0.7,"Restorative-punishment animation: a common resource of circles is over-harvested by Purple; in the individual condition, Green never leaves its corner, then Blue discovers the depletion and alone restores the common resource (returns circles from Purple’s corner to center). Participants rate each triangle using revised items framed as if the behavior occurred in their own group; Punisher, Deviant, and Others composites formed.",Summarizes Study 2 individual-restorative-punishment animation and measurement approach.,1
