ite,Laboratory experiment.,1,"Third-party common resource game. Persons A and B can each harvest up to 100 coins from a 200-coin common pool; harvested coins go to self, and remaining pool coins are multiplied by 1.5 and equally shared. In the scripted feedback, A harvests 20 and B harvests 80 (high vs low cooperators). Observer C has 200 coins to allocate as decrement coins to one target, each costing 1 and reducing target’s payoff by 3. Payment based on lottery selection.",Summarizes task structure for this condition.,1
