ildings.,1,"Dynamic common-pool resource extraction game; 10% regeneration each round up to initial stock; individual max harvest per round depends on current stock (10 trees if stock>50, smaller maxima when stock falls, see Table 1). Game ends after 10 rounds or when stock<5. Each tree worth 0.5 ETB; equal sharing of remaining stock at end of game.",Summarizes key design details directly stated in methods section and Table 1.,1
