man subjects.,1,N/A,No human subjects.,1,No human,Pure simulation study.,1,"Same three-player evolutionary game as baseline. Only δ1 (economic growth weight) and δ2 (ecological environment weight) in LGs’ performance appraisal are varied. Initial state x=y=z=0.5. For higher δ1 and lower δ2 (e.g., δ1=0.4, δ2=0.4), trajectories converge to E1(0,0,0): all choose partial strategies. When δ1 falls below a critical value between 0.2 and 0.3 and δ2 exceeds between 0.5 and 0.6, y converges to 1 while x,z go to 0, yielding E3(0,1,0): CG irregular partial supervision, LGs full implementation, SEs partial compliance.",Summarizes structure and qualitative outcomes of political performance appraisal simulations in Fig. 2.,1
