ds convergence of x to 0, while larger initial y0 and z0 (greater initial tendency of LGs and SEs to fully implement/comply) speed convergence of y→1 and z→1. However, for all tested initial conditions, the system still converges to x→0, y→1, z→1, indicating that the E7 equilibrium is globally attractive in the region considered and robust to initial-condition variation.",Summarizes sensitivity analysis in 4.4.1 and Figs. 7–9.,1
