ut now the threshold M is uncertain: for a group with k cooperators, the success probability P=0 if k<M−δ/2, P=1 if k≥M+δ/2, and P=(k−M+δ/2)/δ otherwise, with δ varied (reported as δ/N).",From Sec. 3 text and Fig. 2 caption.,1
