y r=3.6 and divided equally among all N players. Cooperators pay a punishment cost μ=0.1 and defectors receive fines proportional to ν=0.35 and the number of defectors. Strategy frequencies evolve via approximate best response dynamics parameterized by rationality K, which is varied from near 0 to large values.",Drawn from the model description (Section 2) and parameter values in figure captions.,0.97
