,N/A,Simulated agents.,1,N/A,Simulated agents.,1,N/A,Simulated agents.,1,N/A,Simulated agents.,1,No human,Monte Carlo simulation only.,1,"Finite well-mixed population with N=100; strategies C, D, P, M; group size G=5; parameters r=3, c=1, α=1.0, β=0.7, γ=0.05, selection intensity s=2.0; conditional punishers pay observation cost γ and punish if number of unconditional punishers ≥ H=1. Time evolution shown up to 10^9 time steps (Fig.3(b)) and average frequencies vs mutation rate μ in Fig.4(b).",Gathers simulation and model parameters relevant to this condition.,1
