h value, equal), (3) actor flake, recipient prawn (disadvantageous inequity), (4) actor nothing, recipient flake (reward inequity: presence/absence of reward). Fish are separated by transparent partition so each accesses only their half of the plate and recipients cannot punish actors.","Summary from the ""Are Cleaner Fish Inequity Averse?"" experimental description, including all listed treatments and structural features.",0.98
