ns.,1,N/A,No humans.,1,N/A,No humans.,1,No human,All modeling and simulations.,1,"E-viability lattice model with four strategies (AP, AN, SP, SN) and empty sites; Neumann neighborhood (z=4); initial densities determined by SN/SP=0.4/0.1 and AN/AP=0.2/0.3 with empty sites 0.2; parameters c=q=1; b and p varied; mutation case uses m1=m2=m3=m4=0.001, no-mutation case sets these to 0; asynchronous updating in (a), (b); synchronous updating in (c); outcomes: fraction of runs where SN wins, AP wins or coexists with AN, or dynamics do not converge by 50,000 time units, and typical frequencies under mutation.",Condenses described setup around Fig. 4 for E-viability panels (a–c).,1
