ce.,1,N/A,No human participants.,1,N/A,No human participants.,1,N/A,No human participants.,1,N/A,No human participants.,1,No human,Simulation in a completely mixing population with no human subjects.,1,"Completely mixing E-viability model: in each time step, a site is chosen; if occupied, player interacts with z=4 randomly selected players from the whole population; death probability d_i=α exp(-β s_i); if empty, filled by a random individual from the population; four strategies (AP, AN, SP, SN) and empty sites; parameters c=q=1; b and p varied; outcomes summarized as fractions of runs where different strategies dominate or coexist, matching analytical invasion predictions.",Condenses description in Section 3 and Fig. 6 caption.,1
