sing efficiency of punishment allocation (concentrating punishment on free riders) still allows coexistence of cooperators and punishers, but the mutation–selection equilibrium on P–F edge observed in baseline model may no longer be globally stable.",Summarized from Appendix C discussion of Fig. C1.,1
