plicitly stated to be conducted in Switzerland.,1,Estimated 5–75 years; mean around 40 years across both studies,Only pooled descriptive stats reported.,0.7,Mixed male and female passengers; proportion female about 0.54 across both studies,Overall gender proportion reported; not broken down by condition.,0.7,N/R,Education is not recorded.,0,Field experiment,Standardized interventions in a real-world IC train setting.,1,"Same volunteer’s dilemma structure as Study 1: open-plan IC car on Zurich–Basel line, female confederate plays ‘Robot Rock’ on mobile phone at annoying volume for up to 4:48 minutes; observer records contextual variables and whether any passenger directly requests the music to be turned off.","Procedures for Study 2 stated to be identical to Study 1 except line, confederate gender, and car-type variation.",1
