ey present ρ_c and phase boundaries; no explicit normalized contribution metrics.,0.9,N/R,Outcome measures are mainly fractions of cooperators and phase categories.,0.9,N/R,Efficiency not computed or plotted.,1,N/R,No numeric group payoff reported for this parameter set.,0.8,N/A,No human participants.,1,N/A,No human participants.,1,N/A,No human participants.,1,N/A,No human participants.,1,No human,Entirely simulation-based.,1,"Spatial PGG on 400×400 lattice with overlapping groups of size 5, tolerance threshold M=3. Punishment applied when an agent has defected more than 3 consecutive rounds (t_i>M); punished defectors incur fine α=1 per relevant group; cooperators in the group share cost. r and K scanned to construct phase diagram separating all-C, all-D, and coexistence.","Condensed from Methods and Fig. 5 description for this specific M, α setting.",1
