ne. Punishment stage: after being informed of counterpart's decision and whether the negative event occurred, an agent who invested may choose a punishment amount (up to 24 talers deducted) if the counterpart did not invest. 1 taler spent deducts 3 talers from the non-investor. Negative period earnings truncated at zero.",Design description of SPD_InvPun and punishment rules.,1
