t decisions and seeing counterpart's decision and own current payoff, each player may choose punishment up to 24 talers deducted from counterpart at cost 1:3. Punishment choices are made before learning counterpart's punishment choice. Negative earnings truncated at zero.",DPD_BothPun and punishment design description.,1
