0.6,On site,Lab sessions in Québec and Strasbourg using z-Tree.,1,"Same Liability Game as NL but with strict liability and perfect enforcement. If a participant chooses Harmful, they must pay 12 ECU in damages (3 victims × 4 ECU each), fully compensating others so no one suffers net loss from others’ harmful actions. Net period income: own action payoff (6 for Harmless; 14/16/20/22 for Harmful depending on A/B/C/D) minus 12 ECU if Harmful chosen. Others neither lose nor gain from others' harmful actions due to full compensation. Information and punishment stages as in common setup, with liability status of each other player displayed.",Summarizes rule-specific payoffs and liability for SSL.,1
