chanism.,1,N/A,"No tokens, points, or endowments are assigned to participants.",1,N/A,No behavioral contributions are measured.,1,N/A,No behavioral contributions are measured.,1,N/A,No game or payoff structure from which to compute efficiency.,1,N/A,No experimental payoffs.,1,N/A,No human participants are recruited.,1,N/A,No human participants are recruited.,1,N/A,No human participants are recruited.,1,N/A,No human participants are recruited.,1,No human,The study is purely theoretical with no empirical data collection environment.,1,"The paper proposes a theoretical framework linking cultural idea systems, identity, kinship, emotions, and punishment to explain human cooperation, but does not instantiate any formal game or experimental paradigm.",Summarizes the nature of the work given the absence of a concrete game or experimental design.,1
