ptcy rule: losses limited to one’s own punishment expenditures; 25 ECUs were added after period 10 to reduce bankruptcy risk. Punishments are instrumental: low contributors receive more punishment.",Synthesizes FP enforcement-phase description and punishment behavior findings.,1
