ers; parameters: n=5, r=3, c=1, b=1, g=0.3, σ=1; no pool punishment here; peer punishers pay g per connected defector to reduce each such defector’s payoff by b; evolutionary imitation based on neighbours’ post-punishment payoff over 600 generations with 20 repeated simulations.","Compiled from Model description, Table 1, and discussion around Fig. 4c.",1
