 not provided.,0,Approximately half female,Paper: approximately half of participants overall were female for the initial 3 treatments.,0.8,University students (various majors),Same recruiting pool description applies.,0.9,On site,Run in Bonn EconLab with physical cubicles.,1,"Same linear public good structure as Baseline. Additional Stage 2 each period: participants report whether a norm exists and, if so, the generally expected minimum contribution (0–20). No feedback on others’ norm statements.",Summarized from design description for Norm treatment.,1
