n frequency, not contributions.",1.0,N/A,No contribution amounts defined.,1.0,N/R,They report only fc and counts of revengers/sufferers.,0.3,N/R,No aggregate payoff statistics in the text.,0.2,N/A,No human participants.,1.0,N/A,No human participants.,1.0,N/A,No human participants.,1.0,N/A,No human participants.,1.0,No human,Simulation study only.,1.0,"Same PDG-on-SL setup as baseline: 40×40 lattice with periodic boundaries (degree 4), Fermi imitation with κ = 1, random initial C/D at 50% each, fraction p = 0.1 of players update per round; punishment via revenge mechanism: revenger loses ρ_r = 0.2 of its current payoff each revenge and sufferer loses ρ_s = 1.0 times the relevant revenger payoff component, with punishment order determined by node labels; payoffs R = 1, P = 0, S = −r, T = 1 + r with r = 0.02; simulations over T = 10^4 time steps and averaged over 100 runs; main DV is cooperation frequency fc over time.",Combines model description in Section 2 with specific parameter choice from Fig. 2(a).,0.96
