is specific condition is reported.,0.2,N/A,No human participants.,1,N/A,No human participants.,1,N/A,No human participants.,1,N/A,No human participants.,1,No human,Purely computational simulations without human subjects.,1,Evolutionary public-goods-like P2P resource provision game with four strategies: cooperators (C) provide benefit α1 and pay cost cs; defectors (D) neither contribute nor punish; punishers (P) contribute and punish D incurring cost cu and imposing fine cp; loners (L) abstain and receive outside payoff 0. Groups of size N are drawn from population M without replacement; imitation dynamics follow a Fermi update rule with mutation probability μ and selection intensity β. An entry fee ce is charged to join each round.,Summarized from Sections 3.3–4 and simulation setup text plus parameter specification around Figs. 4 and 9.,0.94
