10.1109_tcss.2022.3144978.md,COVID-19 coauthor hypergraph – BV-learning,"Real-world hypergraph based on COVID-19 coauthor dataset using BV-learning, analyzed in Fig. 13(a)–(c) under the label 'by BV-learning'.",0.88,"Topology=Real-world COVID-19 coauthor hypergraph; Learning algorithm=BV-learning; Coauthor group sizes as in dataset; N=402511 authors; Papers=109148; R=1000000 (per run, as in other simulations)","Section II-C describes the COVID-19 coauthor dataset (402511 authors, 109148 papers). Section IV-B.3 refers to norms on real-world hypergraphs 'by BV-learning'. R assumed same as other simulations.",0.78,False,"Although based on real coauthorship data, the metanorm dynamics are simulated; no human subjects interact during the study.",0.9,False,No interventions or randomization on real people; topological data used as fixed input to simulation.,0.95,False,Not a lab experiment.,1.0,True,Simulation of metanorm game on a fixed real-world hypergraph topology.,1.0,True,Same analytical framework applies; used mainly to interpret but not uniquely derived for this dataset.,0.7,402511,Section II-C: COVID-19 coauthor dataset includes 402511 authors.,1.0,1000000,R=1000000 used for 'each simulation'; assumed same here.,0.8,1,Agents in simulation still make binary cooperation/defection and punishment decisions.,0.78,N/A,No endowment or contribution game is defined on this hypergraph; groups correspond to papers.,1.0,N/A,"Metanorm game, not public goods.",1.0,N/A,No online interaction; simulation only.,1.0,N/A,Agents are algorithmic; no interface.,1.0,N/A,"Identities are graph nodes, not displayed to humans.",1.0,N/A,No rewards.,1.0,N/A,No display to agents.,1.0,1,Metanorm game with punishment is run on this topology as well.,1.0,9,P=-9 same as synthetic topologies.,0.98,1,One application of P per punitive act.,0.7,0,No explicit reward rule added for real-world hypergraph case.,0.98,N/A,Rewards absent.,1.0,N/A,Rewards absent.,1.0,N/R,No endowment parameter is mentioned.,0.4,N/R,"Outcomes are B and V as measures of norms, not contributions.",0.4,N/R,No contribution tokens.,0.4,N/R,No aggregate efficiency values for this real-world topology are reported.,0.3,N/R,Group payoffs by paper are not tabulated.,0.3,N/A,"Although the graph is built from real authors, the experiment is a simulation and does not involve interacting human subjects; we code as no human.",0.9,N/A,No individual-level demographic variables are used.,1.0,N/A,Gender not used or reported.,1.0,N/A,Education not used or reported.,1.0,No human,Simulation on observationally derived network topology.,1.0,"Real-world hypergraph where each paper is a hyperlink and authors are nodes; coauthor group size equals number of authors per paper (variable G). Metanorm game and BV-learning run on this topology. Fig. 13(b) shows that papers with more coauthors (G>4) more easily establish norms (high V, low B); Fig. 13(c) contrasts norms for high-hyperdegree 'active' authors vs low-hyperdegree 'leavers'.",Summarized from Section II-C and Section IV-B.3 discussion and Fig. 13.,0.9
