en separately.,0,N/R,No raw amounts given.,0,0.95,"Text: “Across the two experiments, net yields averaged 95%–94% with fees and fines included.” Taking first experiment as 0.95 for this row.",0.6,N/R,Only efficiency as a fraction is reported.,0,United States,Same as other Ostrom et al. (1992) lab experiments.,0.7,N/R,Not specified.,0,N/R,Not specified.,0,University students,Same Ostrom lab subject pool assumption.,0.7,On site,"Communication described as in-person group discussions, implying physical lab.",0.9,"In this pre-play communication experiment, subjects first meet and agree on an investment strategy and a sanctioning mechanism to punish defectors, then play the CPR game for multiple rounds under that mechanism.",Paraphrases the description that subjects ‘quickly agreed to an investment strategy and a sanctioning mechanism to punish defectors’.,1
