rted.,0.3,N/R,No normalized efficiency metric provided.,0.2,N/R,Group payoff statistics not summarized numerically.,0.2,N/A,No human participants.,1,N/A,No human participants.,1,N/A,No human participants.,1,N/A,No human participants.,1,No human,Analytical and simulation-based model only.,1,"Strategies C, P_pe, D, A_pe play a Prisoner’s Dilemma; peer punishers pay cost α to impose fine β on partners (pro-social punishers target defectors; anti-social punishers target cooperators). Full 4×4 payoff matrix given in Appendix A. Evolutionary dynamics follow a Moran process with low mutation μ→0 and selection intensity ω.","Summarized from main text, Appendix A and E, and Fig. 4A–D.",1
