ants.,1,N/A,No human participants.,1,N/A,No human participants.,1,No human,Purely theoretical and computational model.,1,"Combination of pool pro-social punishment and peer anti-social punishment. Appendix C gives payoff formulas, e.g., in a population of i P_po and N−i A_pe, P_Ppo(i) = [(i−1)(b−c) + (−c−β)(N−i)]/(N−1) − α, and P_Ape(i) = i(b−α)/(N−1) − iβ/(N−i). Other cases follow Appendices A and B. Dynamics governed by Moran process with low μ.","Summarized from Appendix C, Section 3.2, and Fig. 4I–L, Fig. 5A.",1
