dition.,0,12.9,"Table 2: B8, Game B, across all phases, average payoff (insider) is 12.9 tokens per player.",0.8,Germany,Same subject pool and location as other treatments.,0.95,N/R,No numerical age data reported.,0.2,N/R,Gender composition not given.,0,Undergraduate university students,Subjects were undergraduate students from the general student population.,0.95,On site,Sessions run in computer lab.,1,Game B8 is identical to B10 except endowment is 8 (20% lower than Game A); interpreted as collective institutional cost of enabling exclusion. Excluded players continue to receive endowment 8 each round but cannot participate in the public good or exclusion voting until phase end. No exclusion stage in final round of each phase.,Summary from design description of B8 game.,1
