.,0,University students,Recruited from university subject pool.,0.9,On site,Conducted in the physical lab using z-tree.,1,"Same linear public goods game and punishment as EXG GroupMonitor, but in monitoring stage each subject chooses whether to pledge $1 toward group monitoring. Monitoring implemented only if all 4 pledge (unanimity). If threshold not met, no one is eligible to be monitored and pledges are refunded. When implemented, each of 4 is eligible and actually monitored with 66.6% probability (100% if full contributor).",Description in sections 3.2.1–3.2.3; unanimity threshold emphasized.,1
