.,1,"Same heterogeneous PG as Observable Baseline but with free-form chat each period. Each message is accompanied by sender’s type label, so no private information remains. Nearly all groups explicitly discussed and agreed on optimal vector (Highs contribute 4, Low 2) and discussed payoffs of 80 under optimum.",From Section 2.3 and Table 5 (Observable Incentives chat outcomes).,1
