sity students (implied undergraduate/young adult sample),Same participant pool.,0.7,On site,On-site lab experiment with fNIRS.,1,"After experiencing disadvantageous unfairness, participants again act as third parties for 40 trials of 10-yuan splits between an allocator and a receiver. They can pay 3 yuan to accept the allocation, compensate the receiver (increasing the disadvantaged player's payoff by taking from the advantaged player until equal), or punish the allocator (reducing the advantaged player's payoff only). One trial is randomly chosen for payment based on their choice minus the 3 yuan cost.",Summarizes after-unfair third-party game for disadvantageous group.,1
