agers) but not overall cooperation proportions by condition.",0.3,N/A,"Choice is binary cooperate/defect, no continuous contribution.",0.95,N/R,Average payoffs by condition are not reported.,0.2,N/R,No raw payoffs per group/condition are provided.,0.2,China,"Participants were recruited on Credamo and played with 'another person who lives in China', and sampled from five Yangzi Delta cities.",1,N/R,Age was collected but no descriptive statistics by condition are reported.,0.2,N/R,Gender was measured but no summary stats or breakdown by condition are provided.,0.2,N/R,Education level was collected but not summarized in the article.,0.2,Online,"Executed on Credamo, a Chinese crowdsourcing website.",1,"One-shot 2x2 PD against an anonymous partner living in China. Payoff matrix scaled from CEO PD such that proportional differences between outcomes match the original (e.g., mutual cooperation vs. exploitation), but absolute CNY amounts differ; exact numbers not provided. Participants first read a vignette about local business norm violations and an interviewed entrepreneur from their city indicating retaliatory sanctions, then made a single PD choice.",Game description and payoff scaling noted in 'Online Experiment' section; retaliatory norm prime defines this treatment.,0.9
