e-form, anonymous, English chat between paired subjects at the beginning of each match. After chat closes, no further communication is allowed during that match. Δ=1 so quantity can be adjusted every period; noisy price signal and random continuation with δ≈0.90 remain unchanged.",Based on Section 3.1 description of communication treatment combined with base design.,1
