10.3389_fnbeh.2016.00180.md,"CEN / λ = 0.50 (high noise, centralized punishment)",Centralized punishment treatment with λ = 0.50 high noise.,1,Punishment institution: centralized. Signal accuracy λ = 0.50 (high noise).,Condition defined by CEN and λ = 0.50.,1,True,Human lab experiment.,1,True,Randomized between-subject treatment.,1,True,"Performed in EconLab, University of Bonn.",1,False,No simulation-only results.,1,False,No purely analytical experiment.,0.9,5,Five participants per group (4 C-participants + 1 authority).,1,30,Sessions ran for 30 periods.,1,1,Continuous-even contribution choice 0–20.,1,0,Endowment initially in private account.,1,0.4,Common to all treatments.,1,0,No communication channel described.,0.9,1,"Feedback on public good income, punishment, total payoff per round.",0.9,0,No statement that targets see which authority member punished; and there is only one authority whose role is common knowledge; individual identification of actions not indicated.,0.7,0,No reward mechanism.,1,1,Finite 30-round game known.,0.8,1,Authority punishes in second stage.,1,1,Each point distributed costs authority 1.,1,3,Each point reduces target payoff by 3 and others by 1/3.,1,0,No rewards.,1,N/A,Rewards not available.,1,N/A,Rewards not available.,1,20,C-participants’ initial endowment for contribution is 20 tokens.,1,N/R,No numeric normalized contribution reported per condition.,0,N/R,Only qualitative comparisons and graphs.,0,N/R,Efficiency is discussed but not tabulated numerically by treatment.,0,N/R,No explicit group payoff means per treatment.,0,Germany,Same lab and subject pool.,0.9,N/R,Not reported.,0,N/R,Not reported.,0,Mostly undergraduate students from various fields,Identical subject pool description.,1,On site,Laboratory experiment at University of Bonn.,1,"Signal accurate with probability 0.5; otherwise uniformly random among other contributions; authority is sole punisher with max 30 points per target, financed by externalities as in CEN/1.",Summarizes