humans.,1,N/A,No humans.,1,No human,All conditions are simulated agents on a network.,1,"Spatial SDG on a 50×50 periodic square lattice with four neighbors per player. Payoff matrix M_SDG = [[1−ρ/2, 1−ρ],[1,0]] with 0 < ρ < 1. Initial fraction of cooperators = 0.5; initial reputation 1 for cooperators and 0 for defectors; reputation increases by 1 upon cooperation and remains unchanged upon defection. Punishment rule: if a defector's reputation falls below the average of its neighbors, the defector loses δ in fitness and each neighbor bears cost δ/k_x. Strategy updates follow the Fermi rule with K = 0.1. Total of 10^4 MCS, last 10^3 used for measuring average cooperator fraction and payoffs, with up to 20 independent runs.",Compiled from model description and results sections for SDG with punishment.,1
