mulations.,1,"Same lattice SPGG with second-order reputation as in the baseline; here the independent variables are reward degree P1 (integer 1–5) for cooperation with bad neighbors and punishment degree P2 (integer 1–3) for defection against bad neighbors. Reputation bounds [0,100], threshold Z as specified, Fermi update with K=0.5 and ω determined by neighbor reputation; ω baseline 0.001 unless otherwise stated.","Summarizes model features relevant to the P1,P2 grid in figure 4.",1
