tudents.,0.95,N/R,No explicit age data reported.,0,N/R,No gender information given.,0,University students,Recruited from students enrolled at National Taipei University.,1,On site,Lab sessions with physical seating and zTree software.,1,"Same heterogeneous 4-player linear VCM with punishment as in complete network. In the circle punishment network, each subject observes contributions and MPCRs only of the two connected members: one with the same MPCR and one with a different MPCR. Each subject can assign at most one punishment to each of these two; each punishment costs 1 token and reduces the target’s stage-1 payoff by 3 tokens. Stranger matching each period and MPCR types (0.3 or 0.7) randomly reassigned every period.",Network-specific description from Fig. 1 and accompanying text.,1
