op 25% pay 10% of payoff, next 25% pay 5%, bottom 50% pay 0. For SUP, p = 0.5, q = 1 − p = 0.5, so half of defectors are selected each round for a fine of p × b each. Strategy update via Fermi rule with κ = 0.1.",Specifies punishment parameters particular to SUP while keeping rest of model unchanged.,1
