nts (Principles of Economics and general campus recruitment),Same recruitment strategy.,0.9,On site,Same lab sessions.,1,"Same WP institution as other Team group members: after period 5, single expulsion vote (majority required, cost E$0.25 per successful voter, expels to E$5 group); after period 10, single punishment vote where if at least half of Team group vote to punish a member, that member loses E$40 and each successful voter pays E$0.25. Punished subjects remain in Team group and continue to choose contributions in periods 11–15.",Describes specific institutional exposure for punished Team group members.,1
