, E$0.25 per successful voter, expulsion to E$5 group), and punishment vote after period 10 (half-or-more rule, E$40 fine on target, E$0.25 cost to each successful voter, no change in group membership). Reported means: periods 1–5 average contribution 8.49, 6–10: 7.77, 11–15: 2.58.",Uses Table 1 and design description to summarize this aggregate WP Team condition.,1
