), which is not reproduced.",0,N/R,The exact average donation amount for the guideline norms treatment is not reported in the provided excerpt.,0,N/R,No efficiency calculation provided.,0,N/R,No aggregate payoff reported.,0,Japan,Same pool: 1600 individuals in Japan.,1,N/R,Not stated in main text.,0,N/R,Not stated in main text.,0,N/R,Education demographics only referenced as in Appendix A.,0,Online,Same online platform and period.,1,"Same JoD structure, but instructions add: 'However, the store strictly adhered to the guidelines pertaining to infection prevention for customers and employees.'",Section 3.2 gives the exact extra sentence for guideline norms treatment.,1
