 site,Conducted in same physical lab setting.,1,"Stage game identical PD with perfect monitoring of opponent’s action and payoff. No random termination; horizon fixed at 75 periods with anonymous random matching every period. This removes repeated-game incentives (effectively δ=0); theory predicts zero cooperation, but observed ȳ≈0.418.","Section 4: first control has perfect monitoring but random rematching every period, referred to as one-shot (δ=0) and symbolized as β=OS.",1
