nce of 0.833 points.",0.7,Ecuador,Same lab and subject pool.,0.95,Mean 21.6 (range 17–32),Same across treatments.,1,45% women,Same across treatments.,1,"Undergraduate students (35% economics/social science; others in engineering, STEM and related fields)",Same across treatments.,1,On site,Conducted in ESPOL laboratory.,1,"Manager selected by simultaneous, anonymous plurality vote after subjects observe full stage-1 contribution histories. Ties broken randomly by software. Once chosen, manager remains in office for all punishment rounds. Otherwise identical centralized tax/punishment technology and information as Leviathan Single.",From description of endogenous power delegation and single-selection design.,1
10.1017_xps.2020.10.md,"Stage 2 – Multiple selection – Leviathan (exogenous manager, centralized punishment with repeated selection)",Stage 2 treatment with multiple selections and exogenous delegation mechanism.,1,Power delegation: Leviathan (exogenous appointment from within group based on past contributions). Political accountability: Multiple (manager selection every 3 rounds over 12 punishment rounds).,Two-by-two design: this row is Leviathan × Multiple.,1,True,Human-subject lab experiment.,1,True,Controlled randomized treatment implementation.,1,True,Sessions in ESPOL lab.,1,False,No separate simulation treatments.,1,False,No analytical-only conditions.,1,5,Groups of 5 maintained.,1,12,Centralized punishment institution runs for 12 rounds in the multiple-selection treatments.,1,1,Same VCM structure within each round.,1,0,Endowment initially private; contributions chosen by players.,1,0.4,Same m=2 and n=5.,1,0,No communication option is described.,0.95,1,Feedback includes other’s contributions and profits and total punishment points; multiple selection also uses last three rounds’ contributions for selection.,1,0,"Subjects do not observe who was punished, only total punishment in group.",1,0,No reward mechanism.,1,1,Text specifies extension to 12 periods; finite horizon is known; likely displayed.,0.7,1,Centralized punishment is in effect each round.,1,1,Same tax-funded pool and assignment cost as other punishment treatments.,0.8,3,"Same convex mapping from assigned to reduced points (0→0,1→1,…,10→30).",0.5,0,No intentional reward institution.,1,N/A,No reward technology.,1,N/A,No reward technology.,1,20,Same per-round endowment for VCM.,1,N/R,No normalized contribution fraction for this condition.,0.2,2.599,"Panel A, Table 3: Leviathan Multiple cell reports average Punishment−VCM contribution difference of 2.599 points.",0.7,N/R,No efficiency index by treatment reported.,0.1,0.295,"Panel C, Table 3: Leviathan Multiple cell profit difference Punishment−VCM is 0.