10.1017_xps.2020.10.md,"Stage 2 – Multiple selection – Democracy (endogenous manager, centralized punishment with repeated elections)",Stage 2 treatment with multiple selections and democratic delegation.,1,Power delegation: Democracy (manager chosen by plurality vote from within group). Political accountability: Multiple (manager elections every 3 rounds over 12 punishment rounds).,Two-by-two design: this row is Democracy × Multiple.,1,True,Human-subject laboratory experiment.,1,True,Randomly assigned conditions with controlled design.,1,True,Conducted at ESPOL laboratory.,1,False,No simulation-based treatments.,1,False,No analytical-only treatments.,1,5,Group size remains n=5.,1,12,Multiple-selection centralized punishment runs for 12 rounds.,1,1,Same linear VCM contribution decision space.,1,0,Endowment initially private.,1,0.4,Multiplier and group size unchanged.,1,0,No communication facility described.,0.95,1,Feedback includes others’ contributions/profits and total punishment; selection uses prior three rounds’ contributions and stage-1 average.,1,0,Punishment recipients remain anonymous; only total punishment observed.,1,0,No rewards.,1,1,Finite 12-round second stage; likely displayed in oTree.,0.7,1,Centralized punishment with manager each round.,1,1,Same tax and punishment point budget and cost as other punishment treatments.,0.8,3,"Same convex mapping (0→0,1→1,…,10→30) from assigned to reduced points.",0.5,0,No explicit reward system.,1,N/A,No reward system.,1,N/A,No reward system.,1,20,Same endowment as other stages.,1,N/R,No normalized contribution fraction reported.,0.2,1.931,"Panel A, Table 3: Democracy Multiple cell shows average Punishment−VCM contribution difference of 1.931 points.",0.7,N/R,No treatment-level efficiency ratios reported.,0.1,-0.474,"Panel C, Table 3: Democracy Multiple cell shows average Punishment−VCM profit difference of −0.474 points.",0.7,Ecuador,Same lab setting.,0.95,Mean 21.6 (range 17–32),Same subject pool.,1,45% women,Same 