ine on lattice. Jealous sanction rule: if neighbor j’s payoff π_j satisfies π_i < π_j < 2π_i, focal i sanctions j with probability (π_j − π_i)/π_i (as described textually, although formula sign in paper appears inconsistent). Upon sanctioning, i pays cost c_s·π_i and j’s payoff is reduced by p·π_i, with efficiency β = p / c_s. Strategy update rule and initial conditions as in baseline; P_c computed at equilibrium; ensemble averages over 100 runs for each combination of p and game parameters.",Summarizes sanction mechanism and simulation protocol applicable to this condition.,0.96
