y per-agent mean rewards (overall and by type) are provided.,0.2,N/A,No human subjects.,1,N/A,No human subjects.,1,N/A,No human subjects.,1,N/A,No human subjects.,1,No human,All players are simulated agents.,1,"Same endogenous shared punishment TPGG as before with 4 agents and threshold 60, but now two agents are activists constrained to contribute at or above the per-capita threshold (15). Regular players have full strategy sets and can cheap- or free-ride. Voting on punishment and Roth–Erev learning operate for all agents.",Directly based on the description of activists in Section 7 and the 2:2 treatment in Table 4.,1
