bject pool at Tokyo Institute of Technology.,1,N/R,Only student status given.,0.3,N/R,Gender not discussed.,0,Mainly undergraduate students; some graduate students,Same recruitment description applies to all treatments.,0.9,On site,Lab sessions at university computers.,1,Same 4×4 ROSCA with discount factor δ=0.3 and random rematching each round; additional rule: a scheduled recipient who has not contributed in any preceding period cannot receive their payout that round and instead saves 100 points like others who do not contribute.,Summarizes change relative to baseline B.,1
