; 39% major in economics or business,Same participant pool.,1,On site,Laboratory sessions at the university.,1,"Same team production and payoff structure as other conditions. In JO→IC, after observing joint output x, superior states willingness to pay (0.0–5.0 points) in a BDM mechanism to buy information IC={x1,x2}. If random price ≤ WTP, cost is deducted from superior payoff and she sees individual contributions x1,x2 in addition to x before allocating x between subordinates.","Specific additional info mechanism for JO→IC from Sect. 2, 4.1, Table 1.",1
