on.",1,France,"Same subject pool across treatments; lab in Lyon, France.",1,Mean 24.73; distribution not fully reported,Table A1: Mean age 24.73 in Exo1P.,1,47.9% male,Table A1: Males (%) 0.479 for Exo1P.,1,"79.2% students (mainly engineering, business, medical schools)",Table A1: Students (%) 0.792 for Exo1P.,1,On site,Same lab setup as Baseline.,1,"Two-stage per period: Stage 1 taking game identical to Baseline; Stage 2 majority voting to exclude others for 1 period; if excluded, player inactive next period and earns fixed 10 ECU; exclusion requires at least two votes; when N<3, exclusion impossible.",Exo1P treatment description and instructions.,1
