vel.,0.9,N/R,No normalized contribution fraction output reported.,0.9,1,Investment into altruistic behaviour fixed at I=1 for altruistic types in this simulation.,1,N/R,No explicit efficiency metric reported.,0.7,N/R,Only type payoffs are presented analytically; no total group payoff data.,0.7,N/A,No human participants.,1,N/A,No human participants.,1,N/A,"Agent genders are model attributes, not human demographics.",1,N/A,No human participants.,1,No human,Computational simulation only.,1,"Same baseline game as Figure 1A: four types (MP, MD, FC, FD) in constant population N=400 with equal initial frequencies. Here punishment is active with γ=0.4, δ=0.6 while sexual attractiveness parameter s=0.",Condenses treatment-specific differences from baseline description and Figure 1B caption.,1
