ation game payoff matrix: (C,C): b − c to each; (C,D): −c to cooperator, b to defector; (D,D): 0 to each, with b = 2, c = 1 here. Three-strategy model (C, D, P) analogous to weak PD case. For β = −10, ALL and ONE variants again support near full cooperation.","Compiled from Section 4, Equation (donation matrix), and Figure 5 caption.",1
