bBox environment.,1,"Identical to 3E in matching and effort choice, but now each employer sees information about each worker’s past effort, regardless of who employed them. This creates a multilateral reputation mechanism potentially affecting wage offers and hiring decisions.",Section 2.2 describes 3ES as 3E plus shared information about past worker actions.,1
