itions.,1,N/R,Not reported.,1,Online,Same online crowdsourcing environment as other Study 1 condition.,1,"Same SS-TPPG as in Study 1 direct condition: 30 trials, choose between decks with 80/20 vs 20/80 fair/unfair allocations of a 1000-yen endowment (500 vs 100 to recipient). After seeing distribution, participant reports recipient’s amount on an 11-point scale (0–1000 yen in 100-yen steps). No punishment option.",Study 1 methods describe identical deck structure and number of trials; only post-observation action differs.,1
