s treatments.,1,On site,Lab experiment at Wiso-Lab.,1,"Same voluntary contribution mechanism with peer punishment and costly monitoring as in PrivateLow, but with higher monitoring cost κ=1 per monitoring unit, making full monitoring (m_i=2) cost 2 ECU per period. Monitoring decisions remain private and do not inform others before they choose contributions.",Design is identical except for κ and observability; this treatment has κ=1 and private monitoring.,1
