cy measures for Scenario 3.,1,N/R,"No explicit total payoff is presented, only narrative welfare interpretation.",1,N/A,No human respondents.,1,N/A,No human respondents.,1,N/A,No human respondents.,1,N/A,No human respondents.,1,No human,Scenario 3 is a numerical simulation on the analytical model.,1,"Same tripartite evolutionary game. Scenario 3 raises government benefits R1 and the penalty P for not building while keeping construction cost C2 relatively low, under conditions C1+L1−R1+P+A−1<0 and C2−A−P<0. Simulation shows all three populations converge to Regulate, Build, and Satisfied, respectively, yielding equilibrium (Regulate, Build, Satisfied).","Summarizes the ESS identified as (1,1,1) under Scenario 3.",1
