Elab setting.,1,"Two-stage game without human opponent. Stage 1: as in contest, but group K’s winning probability is p_K = sum_K v_k / (sum_K v_k + 25). The 25 tickets are ‘blank tickets’ that, if drawn, forfeit the prize (nobody receives z). Stage 2: each group member receives prize z=100 tokens if a group K ticket is drawn; if a blank ticket is drawn, no one gets prize. Stage 3 in Baseline: players receive F=50 ‘extra tokens’ added directly to their account, with no opportunity to allocate them to others.",Direct description of non-contest environment and Baseline response stage.,1
