eceive share α of defector fines; defectors pay fine when a punisher is present; punishers do not contribute to PGG but pay punishment cost x and receive bonuses from cooperators plus share β of fines. Payoffs: π_C = (r*c*Nc/N) − c − b + (α*Nd*fine)/Nc; π_D = (r*c*Nc/N) − fine; π_P = (r*c*Nc/N) + (b*Nc + β*Nd*fine)/Np − x. Strategy update uses Fermi imitation rule W(Si←Sj) = 1/(1+exp[(π_i−π_j)/K]) with K=0.1. Initial fractions of C, D, P are equal; data from 10^7 iterations averaged over ten runs.",Directly summarized from Model and Simulation sections and payoff equations with α and β.,0.95
