A,This is the sex-symmetric version; but still no human subjects.,1,N/A,No human data.,1,No human,Mathematical/simulation study only.,1,"Same continuous-strategy mating game with parameters l = z = 0.2, α = β = 0.2, c_P = 0.01, c_G = 0.02, y = 0.1, s = 0.4, a = 0.08 (Fig. 2C, 3A–B). Under conditions y > z(1 − β − s) and a > c_P, no single ESS exists; instead p (monogamy), q (guarding), and r (policing/blackmailing) exhibit stable cyclic oscillations forming a limit cycle. All eight pure strategies can coexist in oscillations in the pure-strategy interpretation.",Directly summarizes described parameter values and qualitative dynamics for this treatment.,0.95
