iency statistic provided.,0,N/R,No group payoff data beyond illustrative fake feedback.,0,Japan,Same sample as one-round condition; all Japanese undergraduates.,1,"Mean 18.85, SD 0.73; undergraduates",Pooled Study 1 sample.,1,All female,Study 1 participants described as female undergraduates.,1,Undergraduate students,Sample characteristics.,1,On site,Classroom experiment.,1,Repeated PGG framing identical to one-round except participants were told the experiment would be repeated several times with the same group; in reality game not repeated. Punishment stage with time pressure (5 s) and same discrete punishment options. Mean amount deducted in repeated PGG intuition condition was JPY 504.26.,Directly from Study 1 description for repeated game type and reported deduction mean.,1
