ate ρC=(NC+NP)/N, not converted to contribution proportion explicitly.",0,N/R,No explicit contribution totals reported as DV.,0,N/R,No payoff efficiency metric reported.,0,N/R,Aggregate payoffs not given as results.,0,N/A,No human subjects.,1,N/A,No human subjects.,1,N/A,No human subjects.,1,N/A,No human subjects.,1,No human,All results are from simulations.,1,"Spatial public goods game on a 100×100 lattice with von Neumann neighborhood (G=5). Strategies: C, D, P. Cooperators and punishers contribute 1, defectors 0. Total contributions multiplied by r and shared equally. Defectors may be punished by each punisher with dynamic probability fi(t)=f0^{1/(Xi(t)+1)}. Successful punishment fines β and costs μ·α to punisher, with μ=1−Rsum/(Rmax·5). Reputation dynamics: C: +1, D: −1, P: +T (here T=1), bounded in [0,Rmax]. Strategy update via asynchronous Fermi rule with K=0.5.",Summarizes the full specification of the reputation-based graded punishment model for the T=1 condition.,1
