lies; no per-treatment breakdown.,0.8,University students (various academic backgrounds),Same subject pool.,1,On site,Same experimental site and procedures.,1,"Identical to MAIN in terms of production and theft technology and heterogeneous types (2 Type A, 2 Type B). Difference is that Stage 2 only shows the information table; no exclusion voting is possible at any time.",Section 3.2 explains NoEX differs from MAIN only by removing voting/exclusion in Stage 2.,1
