d T>R>P>S; strategy set includes Private Cooperation (CD), Full Defection (DD), and Tit-for-tat (TFT); replicator dynamics with random mixing; costs of complexity for TFT and initial presence of 5% CD lead to eventual dominance of DD after transient growth of TFT and sheltering of CD.",Summarizes model structure and qualitative dynamics described around Figure 1.,0.9
