ns.,1,N/A,No humans.,1,N/A,No humans.,1,N/A,No humans.,1,No human,Simulation.,1,"Collective solidarity system conceptualized as n-person Volunteers’ Dilemma; from pair view an Altruists’ Dilemma. With 90% poor and 10% rich, Hypocritical Cooperation (DC/dc) yields too little gain to offset costs; Full Defection dominates among both poor (DD) and rich (dd), and informal support for the system (L and l) converges to zero.",Summarizes Figure 6 and accompanying explanation.,0.93
